# counter harness. One force call is one ASE calculate inside the solid-state dimer.
# Archive dimer_rotate.py. rotationOpt is bfgs, phi_tol is 0, dR is 0.001, ss is false.
# maxStep and noZeroModes stay at the constructor defaults.
# rotationMax increases from 1. The initial mode is seed 314159 for every start.
# The harness counts the ASE calls of the scored rotation. Overlap >= 0.99 is a success.
# TSASE forceCalls is not this count.
